{"step_index":273,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-06T00:50:01Z","thinking":"Initial data review reveals 162 rows total. These break down into 81 individual businesses lacking corporate registration numbers, and 81 corporate entities. Amongst the corporate entities, 63 have valid corporate registration numbers confirmed.\n\n\n(13자리 체크섬 100% 정상 일치 확인) indicates successful verification of all listed corporate registration numbers. A total of 63 verified entities now exist, incorporating both existing and newly discovered and validated companies. The confirmed entities and their corresponding registration numbers are now documented.\n\n\nNow incorporating the additional corporate entity listings. Each entry will be validated for correct formatting. Once verified, the data will be appended to the existing, confirmed corporate entity list. The total confirmed entity count will be incremented accordingly.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f2533ba2-96b2-426b-85af-73e28ca73587/scratch/input_batch.tsv', 'utf-8')\\n  .split('\\\\n')\\n  .filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\\n\\nconst results = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f2533ba2-96b2-426b-85af-73e28ca73587/scratch/corps_found_results.json', 'utf-8'));\\n\\n// Map of manually verified / extra found:\\nconst extraFound = {\\n  '7658500671': { corpNo: '184511-0001252', note: '화승코퍼레이션 본점 법인번호' },\\n  '7688801078': { corpNo: '110111-7003140', note: '미르내이앤씨 본사 등기' },\\n  '7698101503': { corpNo: '180111-0676172', note: '(주)씨에스물류 본점 법인번호' },\\n  '7698601439': { corpNo: '180111-1241742', note: '(주)리콘 (원사업자 796-86 오기 수정)' },\\n  '7738501012': { corpNo: '180111-0853390', note: '(주)강봉천흡선 본점 법인번호' }\\n};\\n\\nfunction isValidCorpNo(corpNo) {\\n  if (!corpNo) return false;\\n  const clean = corpNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n  if (clean.length !== 13) return false;\\n  const weights = [1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2];\\n  let sum = 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    sum += Number(clean[i]) * weights[i];\\n  }\\n  const remainder = sum % 10;\\n  const checkDigit = (10 - remainder) % 10;\\n  return Number(clean[12]) === checkDigit;\\n}\\n\\n// Compile complete lookup map for 81 corps\\nconst corpMap = new Map();\\nresults.forEach(r => {\\n  if (r.foundCorpNo && r.valid) {\\n    corpMap.set(r.bizno, { corpNo: r.foundCorpNo, note: '공식 데이터베이스(Bizno)' });\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nfor (const [bizno, data] of Object.entries(extraFound)) {\\n  corpMap.set(bizno, data);\\n}\\n\\nconsole.log('Total verified corps with number:', corpMap.size);\\n\\n// Validate all\\ncorpMap.forEach((v, k) => {\\n  const valid = isValidCorpNo(v.corpNo);\\n  if (!valid) console.log('INVALID:', k, v);\\n});\\nconsole.log('All checksums checked!');\\n\"","Description":"\"Verify all corporate numbers\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\f2533ba2-96b2-426b-85af-73e28ca73587\\\\scratch\\\\verify_all_corps.js\"","toolAction":"\"Verifying corporate numbers\"","toolSummary":"\"Verify corporate numbers\""}}]}
